" end="16.595">her</span> <span begin="16.595" end="17.216">apart</span><span begin="17.216" end="17.587">ment</span> <span begin="17.587" end="17.866">a</span> <span begin="17.866" end="18.191">hun</span><span begin="18.191" end="18.481">dred</span> <span begin="18.481" end="20.258">days</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把自己深锁在她的公寓里一百天</span></p><p begin="21.198" end="24.431" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.198" end="21.761">She</span> <span begin="21.761" end="22.777">says,</span> <span begin="23.056" end="23.294">“Yeah,</span> <span begin="23.294" end="23.584">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="23.584" end="23.886">still</span> <span begin="23.886" end="24.135">com</span><span begin="24.135" end="24.431">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她说：是的，他一定会来的</span></p><p begin="24.431" end="26.486" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.431" end="24.704">Just</span> <span begin="24.704" end="24.989">a</span> <span begin="24.989" end="25.273">lit</span><span begin="25.273" end="25.552">tle</span> <span begin="25.552" end="26.097">bit</span> <span begin="26.097" end="26.486">late</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是有点晚</span></p><p begin="26.736" end="30.728" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.736" end="26.986">He</span> <span begin="26.986" end="27.282">got</span> <span begin="27.282" end="27.543">stuck</span> <span begin="27.543" end="27.810">at</span> <span begin="27.810" end="28.106">the</span> <span begin="28.106" end="28.373">laun</span><span begin="28.373" end="28.669">dro</span><span begin="28.669" end="29.000">mat</span> <span begin="29.197" end="29.526">wash</span><span begin="29.526" end="29.782">ing</span> <span begin="29.782" end="30.264">his</span> <span begin="30.264" end="30.728">cape”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他在洗衣店洗他的披风时遇到了麻烦</span></p><p begin="30.999" end="35.247" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.999" end="31.432">She&apos;s</span> <span begin="31.432" end="32.171">just</span> <span begin="32.705" end="33.088">watch</span><span begin="33.088" end="33.425">ing</span> <span begin="33.425" end="33.738">the</span> <span begin="33.738" end="34.307">clouds</span> <span begin="34.307" end="34.847">roll</span> <span begin="34.847" end="35.247">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她只是看着云朵滚滚而过</span></p><p begin="35.349" end="37.346" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.349" end="35.668">And</span> <span begin="35.668" end="35.941">they</span> <span begin="35.941" end="36.208">spell</span> <span begin="36.208" end="36.516">her</span> <span begin="36.516" end="37.346">name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它们把她的名字拼得</span></p><p begin="38.054" end="39.354" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.054" end="38.286">Like</span> <span begin="38.286" end="38.901">Lois</span> <span begin="38.901" end="39.354">Lane</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像露易丝·莱恩(超人的女主角)</span></p><p begin="39.481" end="41.732" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.481" end="40.027">And</span> <span begin="40.027" end="40.458">she</span> <span begin="40.458" end="41.732">smiles,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而她笑着</span></p><p begin="42.809" end="46.081" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.809" end="43.768">Oh</span> <span begin="43.768" end="44.061">the</span> <span begin="44.061" end="44.578">way</span> <span begin="44.578" end="45.022">she</span> <span begin="45.022" end="46.081">smiles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦~她笑着的样子...</span></p><p begin="48.512" end="52.657" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.512" end="48.732">She&apos;s</span> <span begin="48.732" end="49.011">talk</span><span begin="49.011" end="49.342">ing</span> <span begin="49.342" end="49.632">to</span> <span begin="49.632" end="50.248">an</span><span begin="50.248" end="50.782">